# Documentation dependencies of the flit-era releases (up to v1.2.9), an input of pin.py.
# The `doc` extra of the tags cannot be used: up to v1.1.2 it pins sphinx 4.3.2 and a
# sphinx-book-theme that predates the version switcher.
sphinx
sphinx-book-theme
sphinx-gallery
sphinx-sitemap
sphinx-notfound-page
